  "solution": "By using the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/6607a92e2e2d65c1142117876b706185eaa33ed0ff837d940480af3d3004e7d3.png] \n\n**Option 1)** +,=,−,×,÷,−\n\nGiven equation:- 42 * 4 * 69 * 3 * 29 * 60 * 5\n\nInterchange the mathematical sign with *,\n\nWe get: 42 + 4 = 69 - 3 × **29 ÷ 60** - 5\n\n⇒ 46 = 69 - **3 × 0.4833** - 5\n\n⇒ 46 = 69 **- 1.45 - 5**\n\n⇒ 46 ≠ 62.55\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 2)** ×,−,=, ×,+,÷\n\nGiven equation:- 42 * 4 * 69 * 3 * 29 * 60 * 5\n\nInterchange the mathematical sign with *,\n\nWe get: 42 × 4 - 69 = 3 × 29 + **60 ÷ 5**\n\n⇒ **42 × 4** - 69 = **3 × 29** + 12\n\n⇒ 168 - 69 = **87__ __+ 12**\n\n**⇒ ****168 - 69** = 99\n\n⇒ 99 = 99\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option 3)** +,÷,=,−,×,+\n\nGiven equation:- 42 * 4 * 69 * 3 * 29 * 60 * 5\n\nInterchange the mathematical sign with *,\n\nWe get: 42 + **4 ÷ 69** = 3 - 29 × 60__** **__+ 5\n\n⇒ 42 + 0.05797 = 3 - **29 × 60**__ __+ 5\n\n⇒ **42 + 0.05797** = **3** - 1740 **+ 5**\n\n⇒ 42.05797 = **8 - 1740**\n\n⇒ 42.05797 ≠ -1732\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 4)** −,=,×,+,×,÷ \n\nGiven equation:- 42 * 4 * 69 * 3 * 29 * 60 * 5\n\nInterchange the mathematical sign with *\n\nWe get: 42 - 4 = 69 × 3 + 29 ×** 60 ÷ 5**\n\n⇒ 42 - 4 = **69 × 3 **+ **29 × 12**\n\n⇒ 42 - 4 = **207 + 348**\n\n⇒ **42 - 4** ≠ 555\n\n⇒ 38 ≠ 555\n\n⇒** LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nTherefore, only \"×,−,=, ×,+,÷\" satisfies the given equation\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"×,−,=, ×,+,÷****\".**",
